title: "Replication files — Climate-Contingent Sovereign Finance"
abstract: >-
  Replication code for the quantitative results (Section 5 and Appendix C) of
  "Climate-Contingent Sovereign Finance" (MDY-2026-0066, revised version),
  together with a Lean 4 / mathlib project that machine-checks the
  manuscript's closed-form claims.
